{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/4d23ad4b08d2ed43b86dc3e0ff290acb.avif?t=1770104524\" width=1360 height=398 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/e1562626c7051313491a6067a17b6e80.avif?t=1770104524\" width=680 height=71 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3f <strong>Tiny Isle</strong> is a cozy island-building simulation where you care for a magical, secluded island. Discover a mysterious sprite civilization and help them rebuild their home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf31 Grow adorable magical crops, collect sparkling crystals \ud83d\udc8e, catch fantastical fish \ud83c\udfa3, and welcome charming animal villagers and sprites. Use crystals to expand your island, unlock cute plants like magical mushrooms \ud83c\udf44 and flowers, and freely decorate the island as it slowly comes back to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f3 Play actively with hands-on systems, or relax with full idle progression. Enjoy a calm, shared moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 If you\u2019re looking for a soothing game with depth, charm, and a gentle pace, <strong>Tiny Isle</strong> might become your little haven.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/2179becfd77202f3208b70c9d0dce3e4.avif?t=1770104524\" width=680 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaeEasy-to-learn gameplay with no complex stats or overwhelming management systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfdd\ufe0fFull terrain and decoration customization to create your unique island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc8eCultivate crops across your island to harvest Crystals, then spend them to unlock new plant varieties and gradually expand your territory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf31Every crop has its own superpower!  Some produce, some deliver, others boost your yields\u2014mix them right to skyrocket your Crystal output!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/2ad38b3c30515b212cb4e05b6ebe3892.avif?t=1770104524\" width=1360 height=809 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/50303cbb7bff2fa9566e07344890d21a.avif?t=1770104524\" width=1360 height=809 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/e8de36d08416e46bc0e90edafb886b07.avif?t=1770104524\" width=680 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf33In addition to the island's indigenous inhabitants, new residents can also be recruited through tree hollows to temporarily settle on the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddda\u200d\u2640\ufe0fEach resident possesses unique appearances and personalities, and they will assist with the island's production in their own distinctive ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfd8\ufe0fBecome besties with the locals, and they\u2019ll put down permanent roots on your island!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/a23e09768629f67fb55f9471871ea085.avif?t=1770104524\" width=1360 height=936 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/11442186a51d69aedb3b9a2133c997a7.avif?t=1770104524\" width=1360 height=809 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/b14d544bdb2d25c39fd745f712e724ab.avif?t=1770104524\" width=680 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa3Cast your line around the island for a relaxing fishing trip!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc1fReel in all kinds of fish, then\u2014once you've honed your skills\u2014aim to break size records and even challenge legendary Fish Kings!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/f9d15618339371ce5fe11fc73d6b8ea6.avif?t=1770104524\" width=1360 height=809 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/d1efa4bd8612845ce40e62dadfe84c3d.avif?t=1770104524\" width=1360 height=809 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/ded3186c7d4386fda2b0c8200d2d4048.avif?t=1770104524\" width=680 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2600\ufe0fYour island shifts moods with time and weather\u2014sunny vistas, stormy drama, even magical sky surprises!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/88f3ae08038ebcdd4ad023961bef2081.avif?t=1770104524\" width=1360 height=809 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/a8aaa81edebf87be0b281593a888b72c.avif?t=1770104524\" width=1360 height=809 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/931aac560e10215e34da82e73881df7a.avif?t=1770104524\" width=1360 height=809 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/020f422b1752ea0cb865989e7217425f.avif?t=1770104524\" width=680 height=76 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf1f <strong>Thank you for your interest and support for <i>Tiny Isle</i>!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you run into any issues while playing\u2014or if you have fun ideas and creative thoughts to share\u2014you're warmly welcome to join our official <strong><u>Discord</u></strong>. Let\u2019s make this little island even more wonderful, together!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Legendary Fish Dude","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3337180/9a2c62d150ea6e15378a594d36f3f0453b70de48.jpg"},{"name":"Spirit Crossing","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3337180/e5ed77807612cfbd2edf52f6e540aa73b4504819.jpg"},{"name":"Crop of the Year","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3337180/a5af462572bd2b7b9ea8c8910b3926743acaf735.jpg"},{"name":"Wonders Ruin Nations","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3337180/6c67555864459810b3af9c72130ec08366f37a96.jpg"},{"name":"Gol