Crystals, then spend them to unlock new plant varieties and gradually expand your territory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf31Every crop has its own superpower!  Some produce, some deliver, others boost your yields\u2014mix them right to skyrocket your Crystal output!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/2ad38b3c30515b212cb4e05b6ebe3892.avif?t=1770104524\" width=1360 height=809 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/50303cbb7bff2fa9566e07344890d21a.avif?t=1770104524\" width=1360 height=809 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/e8de36d08416e46bc0e90edafb886b07.avif?t=1770104524\" width=680 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf33In addition to the island's indigenous inhabitants, new residents can also be recruited through tree hollows to temporarily settle on the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddda\u200d\u2640\ufe0fEach resident possesses unique appearances and personalities, and they will assist with the island's production in their own distinctive ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfd8\ufe0fBecome besties with the locals, and they\u2019ll put down permanent roots on your island!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337180/extras/a23e09768629f67fb55f9471871ea085.avif?t=1770104524\" width=1360 height=936 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor